# local-only scratch (never commit)
.pi-subagents/

# The Claude plugin's scripts-root bundle vendors yaml/zod/@dev-loops/core verbatim into
# .claude/node_modules/ so the generated .claude/ tree is committed and shipped (unlike a real
# node_modules cache). Un-ignore it explicitly — it must win over the blanket node_modules/ rule.
# The nested-directory negation is load-bearing: a vendored dep carries `dist/` dirs, which the
# blanket `dist/` rule above excludes; git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory stays
# excluded, so the subdirectories themselves must be re-included before their files.
!.claude/node_modules/
!.claude/node_modules/**/
!.claude/node_modules/**
